---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Our Work | Ethnoir"
  description="What Ethnoir has delivered, what the evidence supports and what it learned from its six-week Venture Readiness Lab pilot."
>
  <!-- SECTION 1: OPENING MASTHEAD -->
  <section class="bg-parchment" style="padding: var(--space-2xl) 0 var(--space-xl) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary);">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <!-- Masterhead Headline -->
      <div class="col-12 lg-col-11" style="padding-bottom: var(--space-sm);">
        <h1 class="voice-1" style="font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 6.5vw, 5.25rem); margin: 0; line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -0.025em; color: var(--color-tidal-ink);">
          Our Work and Experience
        </h1>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Intro Block (No Dividing Line) -->
      <div class="col-12" style="padding-top: var(--space-sm);">
        <div class="grid-12" style="margin: 0;">
          <div class="col-12 md-col-9 lg-col-8">
            <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2vw, 1.45rem); line-height: 1.5; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); margin: 0;">
              Ethnoir’s work connects program design, practical implementation, operating systems and learning. Explore the Venture Readiness Lab and the professional experience behind our approach.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION 2: PRINCIPAL COMPLETED CASE - VENTURE READINESS LAB -->
  <section class="bg-porcelain chapter chapter-large-spacing">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <!-- Left Column: Endorsement Badge -->
      <div class="col-12 md-col-4 lg-col-3" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);">
        <div style="position: sticky; top: calc(var(--space-xl) + 60px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-lg);">
          <!-- Institutional Support Badge -->
          <div style="border: 1px solid var(--color-quiet-rule); background-color: var(--color-parchment); padding: var(--space-md); border-radius: 2px;">
            <p class="voice-3" style="font-size: 0.8125rem; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--color-muted-slate); margin: 0 0 var(--space-sm) 0;">
              This activity received support from NC IDEA.
            </p>
            <img
              src="/images/nc-idea-logo.svg"
              alt="NC IDEA"
              width="90"
              height="24"
              style="height: 20px; width: auto; opacity: 0.9; display: block;"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Right Column: Case Showcase -->
      <div class="col-12 md-col-8 lg-col-9">
        <div style="border-left: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary); padding-left: clamp(var(--space-md), 4vw, var(--space-2xl));">
          <h2 class="voice-1" style="font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 4.5vw, 3.75rem); line-height: 1.1; margin: 0 0 var(--space-sm) 0; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); letter-spacing: -0.02em;">
            From Business Problems to Practical Structure
          </h2>
          
          <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2vw, 1.45rem); line-height: 1.45; color: var(--color-deep-teal); margin-bottom: var(--space-xl); max-width: 680px;">
            What a six-week founder pilot taught Ethnoir about the gap between spotting a business problem and putting a useful fix in place.
          </p>
          
          <!-- Narrative Frame -->
          <div style="background-color: var(--color-parchment); border: 1px solid var(--color-quiet-rule); border-left: 3px solid var(--color-deep-teal); padding: clamp(var(--space-md), 3vw, var(--space-xl)); margin-bottom: var(--space-xl); max-width: 720px;">
            <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
              The Venture Readiness Lab was a six-week virtual pilot for six active founders. Ethnoir combined a shared program structure with individual work on each founder’s own business problem.
            </p>
            <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); margin-bottom: 0;">
              All six reached the final session, and five had structural deliverables that Ethnoir’s Founder reviewed and confirmed. The pilot is practical evidence about moving from a visible problem to a working fix, and about what must be tested before any broader claim or scale.
            </p>
          </div>
          
          <div>
            <a href="/our-work/venture-readiness-lab" class="btn-primary" style="background-color: var(--color-tidal-ink); color: var(--color-porcelain); padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-xl); font-size: 1rem; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-xs); text-decoration: none; border-radius: 2px;">
              Read the full case study &rarr;
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION 3: BPEACE CASE STUDY -->
  <section class="bg-porcelain chapter chapter-large-spacing" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary);">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <!-- Left Column: Engagement Context Badge -->
      <div class="col-12 md-col-4 lg-col-3" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);">
        <div style="position: sticky; top: calc(var(--space-xl) + 60px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-md);">
          <div style="border: 1px solid var(--color-quiet-rule); background-color: var(--color-parchment); padding: var(--space-md); border-radius: 2px;">
            <p class="voice-3" style="color: var(--color-muted-slate); font-size: 0.8125rem; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">
              Bpeace &middot; Breaking the $1M Barrier &middot; North Carolina and Georgia &middot; 2025&ndash;2026
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Right Column: Case Showcase -->
      <div class="col-12 md-col-8 lg-col-9">
        <div style="border-left: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary); padding-left: clamp(var(--space-md), 4vw, var(--space-2xl));">
          <h2 class="voice-1" style="font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 4.5vw, 3.75rem); line-height: 1.1; margin: 0 0 var(--space-sm) 0; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); letter-spacing: -0.02em;">
            Coordinating the People and Processes Behind a Founder-Support Program
          </h2>
          
          <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2vw, 1.45rem); line-height: 1.45; color: var(--color-deep-teal); margin-bottom: var(--space-xl); max-width: 680px;">
            Connecting program goals with practical delivery for Bpeace’s Breaking the $1M Barrier program across North Carolina and Georgia.
          </p>
          
          <!-- Narrative Frame -->
          <div style="background-color: var(--color-parchment); border: 1px solid var(--color-quiet-rule); border-left: 3px solid var(--color-deep-teal); padding: clamp(var(--space-md), 3vw, var(--space-xl)); margin-bottom: var(--space-xl); max-width: 720px;">
            <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
              Bpeace’s Breaking the $1M Barrier program brought together coaching, group learning and regional Showcases for 21 companies. Delivery required coordination across founders, program staff, volunteer specialists and facilitators, with clear expectations, preparation and operating processes.
            </p>
            <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); margin-bottom: 0;">
              Implementation work within Bpeace’s delivery team included guidance for coaches and facilitators, peer-learning design and facilitation, founder onboarding, Showcase preparation, stakeholder coordination, and reporting and learning synthesis. The case demonstrates how program design, operating systems and contributor preparation come together to support institutional program delivery.
            </p>
          </div>
          
          <div>
            <a href="/our-work/bpeace-breaking-the-1m-barrier" class="btn-primary" style="background-color: var(--color-tidal-ink); color: var(--color-porcelain); padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-xl); font-size: 1rem; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-xs); text-decoration: none; border-radius: 2px;">
              Read the full case study &rarr;
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION 3: RELATED ROUTES -->
  <section class="bg-quiet-sand chapter chapter-moderate-spacing" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary);">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="col-12">
        <div class="grid-12" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary);">
          <!-- Pathway 1: For Organizations -->
          <div class="col-12 md-col-6 border-right-md" style="padding-top: var(--space-lg); padding-bottom: var(--space-xl); padding-right: clamp(var(--space-md), 3vw, var(--space-xl));">
            <div style="background-color: var(--color-porcelain); border: 1px solid var(--color-quiet-rule); padding: var(--space-lg); height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; border-radius: 2px;">
              <div>
                <h3 class="voice-1" style="font-size: 1.625rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); line-height: 1.2;">
                  <a href="/for-organizations" style="color: var(--color-tidal-ink); text-decoration: none;">For Organizations &rarr;</a>
                </h3>
                <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--color-muted-slate); margin: 0;">
                  Examine the connection between participant needs and the support offered, and explore practical decisions about design, delivery and measurement.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Pathway 2: Venture Readiness Check-In -->
          <div class="col-12 md-col-6" style="padding-top: var(--space-lg); padding-bottom: var(--space-xl); padding-left: clamp(0px, 3vw, var(--space-xl));">
            <div style="background-color: var(--color-porcelain); border: 1px solid var(--color-quiet-rule); padding: var(--space-lg); height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; border-radius: 2px;">
              <div>
                <h3 class="voice-1" style="font-size: 1.625rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); line-height: 1.2;">
                  <a href="/venture-readiness-check-in" style="color: var(--color-tidal-ink); text-decoration: none;">Venture Readiness Check-In &rarr;</a>
                </h3>
                <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--color-muted-slate); margin: 0;">
                  A short resource for deciding what to look at next in your business.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .border-right-md { border-right: 1px solid var(--color-quiet-rule); }
  }
</style>
